				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				81,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Subscribe to Mountain extension events for live sidebar updates\n\nAdd the ExtensionChangeSubscriber module that listens to Mountain's\n`sky://extensions/installed` and `sky://extensions/uninstalled` events\nand forwards them to the VS Code workbench's ExtensionEnablementService.\nThis enables the sidebar to refresh live after a VSIX install or uninstall\n— no workbench reload required.\n\nThe subscriber is imported and started in Bootstrap.ts as Wave 7 of the\nElectron boot sequence, only when LAND_ENABLE_WIND !== \"false\". It uses\nEffect.runFork for fire-and-forget semantics so the boot path never blocks\non a stream that by definition never completes. Missing refresh hooks are\nhandled gracefully with best-effort logging.\n\nThis implements the K2/K3 milestone for live extension state synchronization\nbetween Mountain and the Wind/Sky frontend.",
			"SHA": "96d6019e641f2c2d82a8038c249e65717f25d1cd"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-21T23:43:38Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				80,
				2
			],
			"Message": "Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Sky into Current",
			"SHA": "4be63e138023df836e2c51cdd08dd5b8330c8046"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-21T23:42:40Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				80,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Add LAND_ENABLE_WIND to conditionally skip Wind bootstrap\n\nIntroduce the `LAND_ENABLE_WIND` environment variable (Atom N2) that allows\nthe Electron workbench to bypass the Effect-TS service layer entirely.\n\nWhen set to \"false\" at build time, Vite inlines the comparison and the\nentire Wind import chain is tree-shaken from the production bundle. This\nenables \"Mountain + bare workbench\" integration tests and produces the\nsmallest shippable surface where gRPC/Tauri IPC isn't desired.\n\nThe flag is mirrored into Vite's `define` config with a default of \"true\"\nso Wind loads for all profiles that don't explicitly opt out.",
			"SHA": "d2c55674c94e42aae489d001233c0a965329f97f"
		}
	],
	"TimeStamp": 1778164511793
}